      "Description": {
        "Namespace": "",
        "Key": "36C2B8244B35CF94D923328EACE0027C",
        "SourceString": "Veylnor, is a deity shrouded in darkness and mystery, embodying the depths of night and the unseen forces that govern fate. This primordial god exists in the shadows, influencing events from behind a veil of obscurity. Veylnor's presence is felt in moments of uncertainty and introspection, guiding those who dare to seek truth in darkness. Legends speak of his ability to weave destinies, granting insight or confusion to those who invoke his name. He accepts offerings from mortals with a promise of protection or revelation, reminding them that not all paths are illuminated.",
